    "https://jobs.gre.ac.uk/registration": {
      "title": "Registration",
      "description": "Registration - Jobs at Greenwich Skip to main content Jobs home Login Register Current vacancies Staff Visa Compliance Working at Greenwich Search jobs Equality, diversity and inclusion Sustainability Frequently asked questions Applying Contact us Terms and conditions Cookies Accessibility Faculties Portal Jobs home Login Register More ▼ Cookies This site requires the use of cookies as defined by our Terms and Conditions . \n        We have provided a detailed description of how cookies work and are used on the site . \n        To accept cookies, please click the \"Accept Cookies\" button. Accept cookies Registration If you have not previously registered to make an online application for a vacancy simply follow the registration details below after which you will be able to make and submit your application. It is a good idea to read all about the application process before registering. If you have previously registered you should login using the details you created when registering rather than creating a new account. Details * denotes a compulsory field Title * Dr Miss Mr Mrs Ms Mx Professor Forenames * Surname * Email address * Confirm Email address * Password must be a minimum of 10 characters, and must contain 3 of the following: upper case letter, lower case letter, numerical digit, any other character. Please remember that passwords are case-sensitive and spaces are not allowed. Password * Confirm Password * Terms & conditions I have read and accept the terms & conditions * Cookies In order to use this site I accept cookies * Verification: Please click the \"Register\" button within 1 minute of completing the verification.  After 1 minute the verification will expire and you must complete it again. Register In this section Current vacancies Staff Visa Compliance Working at Greenwich Search jobs Equality, diversity and inclusion Sustainability Frequently asked questions Applying Find jobs Jobs by email Jobs by RSS Search jobs: Search Advance